{"meta":{"version":2,"built":"static","curatedChunks":27,"pageChunks":250},"company":{"name":"GURU AI TECHNOLOGIES","shortName":"GURU AI","location":"Pune, Maharashtra, India","phone":"+91 80876 95569","whatsappUrl":"https://wa.me/918087695569","email":"contact@guruaitechnologies.com","hours":"Monday to Saturday, 10:00 AM to 7:00 PM IST","website":"https://guruaitechnologies.com","languages":["English","Hinglish","Roman Marathi"]},"chunks":[{"id":"company-profile","type":"company","title":"About GURU AI TECHNOLOGIES","url":"/about","keywords":["about","company","who","studio","pune","founder","team","gururai","guru ai","kaun","kon"],"text":"GURU AI TECHNOLOGIES is a software and AI studio based in Pune, Maharashtra, India. It began with web development and grew into custom software, billing systems, AI chatbots and business automation. The studio focuses on the businesses behind the brief: salons, clinics, retail shops, manufacturers and local service providers. Websites, custom software, chatbots and automation are delivered remotely for clients in India and internationally; the GST-focused billing software serves Indian businesses. The team is led by a Founder & CEO (engineering and technical direction) and a Managing Director (delivery and client relationships). Clients speak directly with the people building their product, with no account-management layer."},{"id":"company-positioning","type":"company","title":"Why choose GURU AI","url":"/#why","keywords":["why","choose","different","advantage","benefit","trust","quality","security","mobile-first"],"text":"Four principles: production-grade engineering (clean, modular code ready for real traffic); security by default (hardened headers, sanitized inputs, safe integrations); mobile-first design tested on real devices; and direct partnership with the people building the product, with clear updates, honest timelines and support after launch. One team covers billing software, AI chatbots, production websites and cloud infrastructure, so clients do not need to coordinate several vendors."},{"id":"company-clients","type":"company","title":"Clients and case studies","url":"/case-studies/","keywords":["client","clients","customer","portfolio","case study","case studies","work","projects","reference","accusize","salon","jewellers","rangrez","maaax"],"text":"Businesses named on the GURU AI website as clients: Accusize Gauges & Tools Pvt Ltd (precision gauge manufacturer, Pune: custom ERP, quotation system, website and calibration tracking), 7S Family Salon (multi-branch salon group: booking website and billing software), Infinity Unisex Salon (salon chain running the GURU AI chatbot for appointment booking), G Jewellers (jewellery retailer: billing and inventory software), Rangrez (premium cloth and fashion store, Maharashtra: business website) and MAAAX Men's Hub (multi-branch men's fashion retail chain, Pune: billing software). Three published case studies: Accusize Gauges & Tools, Salon + AI Chatbot (MR.COOL), and GURU AI's own Billing & Management Software."},{"id":"case-accusize","type":"company","title":"Case study: Accusize Gauges & Tools","url":"/case-studies/accusize","keywords":["accusize","manufacturing","erp","calibration","gauge","case study"],"text":"A website, an internal ERP and calibration tracking for a Pune precision gauge manufacturer. The ERP covers inventory, production and billing; calibration tracking keeps instrument history and records; the public website presents the catalogue and business."},{"id":"case-salon","type":"company","title":"Case study: Salon + AI chatbot","url":"/case-studies/salon-ai-chatbot","keywords":["salon","chatbot","mr.cool","appointment","beauty","case study"],"text":"Mobile-first websites and MR.COOL, GURU AI's reusable AI chatbot, help Pune salons answer common questions and guide customers toward appointments, even when the front desk is busy. Work covers salon clients including Infinity Unisex Salon and The 7S Family Salon."},{"id":"case-billing","type":"company","title":"Case study: GURU AI Billing & Management Software","url":"/case-studies/billing-software-gat","keywords":["billing","gst","invoice","inventory","python","tkinter","case study"],"text":"An internal product story: GURU AI rebuilt its earlier Python and Tkinter billing application into Billing & Management Software with GST-ready invoicing, inventory tracking and daily reporting. It is the shared foundation behind 16 industry-specific billing systems."},{"id":"contact-channels","type":"contact","title":"Contact GURU AI","url":"/#contact","keywords":["contact","phone","call","whatsapp","email","mail","reach","human","person","team","talk","number","sampark","address","office","hours","timing","open"],"text":"WhatsApp and phone: +91 80876 95569 (https://wa.me/918087695569). Email: contact@guruaitechnologies.com (role mailboxes such as sales@, support@ and careers@ also exist on the domain). Business hours: Monday to Saturday, 10:00 AM to 7:00 PM IST; the website says messages are answered within 24 hours, Monday to Saturday. Location: Pune, Maharashtra, India (no street address is published). The contact form is on the homepage at /#contact."},{"id":"faq-cost","type":"faq","title":"FAQ: How much does a website or software project cost?","url":"/#faq","keywords":["cost","price","pricing","how much","quote","budget","kitna","paisa"],"text":"Every business is different, so GURU AI does not publish fixed prices. Share your requirements on WhatsApp or through the contact form and the team sends a clear, custom quote, usually within 24 hours."},{"id":"faq-time","type":"faq","title":"FAQ: How long does a typical project take?","url":"/#faq","keywords":["time","timeline","duration","how long","weeks","delivery","kitna time","kab"],"text":"A premium business website usually takes 1 to 3 weeks. Custom software, apps and automation projects are scoped individually: a realistic timeline is given before work starts, with honest updates throughout."},{"id":"faq-mobile","type":"faq","title":"FAQ: Will my website work well on mobile?","url":"/#faq","keywords":["mobile","responsive","phone","tablet"],"text":"Yes. Designs are mobile-first and tested on real phone, tablet and desktop sizes, with no broken layouts, no horizontal scrolling and fast loading even on 4G."},{"id":"faq-support","type":"faq","title":"FAQ: Do you provide support after launch?","url":"/#faq","keywords":["support","maintenance","after launch","post-launch","updates","backup"],"text":"Yes. Every project includes post-launch support, and ongoing maintenance plans are available for updates, backups and improvements."},{"id":"faq-ai-existing","type":"faq","title":"FAQ: Can you add AI to my existing website or business?","url":"/#faq","keywords":["existing","add ai","integrate","upgrade","already have"],"text":"Yes. GURU AI can add chatbots, automation or smart features to what a business already has; a full rebuild is not required to benefit from AI."},{"id":"faq-location","type":"faq","title":"FAQ: Where are you located and do you work remotely?","url":"/#faq","keywords":["location","where","remote","office","pune","address","international","abroad","kahan","kuthe"],"text":"GURU AI is based in Pune, Maharashtra, and works with clients across India and internationally. It is remote-first: calls are scheduled around the client's time zone, updates happen in writing so nothing waits on a meeting, and projects can be previewed live from anywhere. No street address is published on the website."},{"id":"policy-privacy","type":"policy","title":"Privacy and data handling","url":"/legal/privacy","keywords":["privacy","data","gdpr","personal","consent","cookies","terms","policy","information","security","safe","confidential"],"text":"GURU AI publishes Privacy, Terms and Cookies pages (/legal/privacy, /legal/terms, /legal/cookies). Through this assistant, details are only stored when the visitor explicitly confirms and consents to a project enquiry; full chat conversations are not stored. The assistant never asks for passwords, payment details or OTPs."},{"id":"policy-commitments","type":"policy","title":"What the assistant can and cannot promise","url":"/#contact","keywords":["guarantee","promise","warranty","commitment","certification","sla","contract","agreement","nda"],"text":"The website publishes no guarantees, certifications, SLAs or contract terms, so the assistant does not state any. Questions about contracts, NDAs, guarantees or legal terms should go to the team on WhatsApp or email."},{"id":"pricing-policy","type":"pricing","title":"Pricing policy: custom quotes","url":"/#contact","keywords":["price","pricing","cost","quote","quotation","rate","budget","package","plan","charges","fees","discount","cheap","expensive","kitna","paisa","kiti"],"text":"GURU AI works on custom quotes per project. There are no published fixed prices, rate cards or price ranges, and the assistant cannot estimate a price. A quote is prepared from the requirements (features, scale, timeline). The website says a clear custom quote usually follows within 24 hours of sharing requirements on WhatsApp or the contact form. Budgets can be shared optionally when starting an enquiry; this does not commit either side."},{"id":"process-steps","type":"process","title":"How GURU AI works: five steps","url":"/#process","keywords":["process","how do you work","steps","workflow","methodology","stages","kaise kaam","kasa kaam","engagement","start","onboarding"],"text":"Five clear steps. 1 Discover: understand the business, goals and users before writing code. 2 Design: wireframes and a visual direction the client approves, so there are no surprises. 3 Build: clean, modular development with regular previews the client can open on their phone. 4 Test: checks across key devices, browsers and business workflows, including performance, accessibility and security. 5 Launch & Support: deployment, monitoring and post-launch support. Clients work directly with the founders and senior engineers; calls are scheduled around the client's time zone and updates are written."},{"id":"process-start","type":"process","title":"How to start a project","url":"/#contact","keywords":["start","begin","project","enquiry","inquiry","get started","hire","new project","requirement","quote"],"text":"To start: share a short description of the project through this assistant (it can take the details and pass them to the team once the visitor confirms), the homepage contact form, WhatsApp or email. The team then replies with next steps and, for pricing, a custom quote. Nothing is booked or priced automatically."},{"id":"services-overview","type":"service","title":"All GURU AI services","url":"/services/","keywords":["services","offer","provide","what do you do","kya karte","kay karta","list","capabilities"],"text":"GURU AI offers ten core services: AI-Powered Websites, Custom Software Development (CRM, ERP, HRMS, LMS, inventory, property management, helpdesk, e-commerce platforms, BI dashboards, SaaS platforms, document management, customer portals, fleet management and AI agents), AI Business Automation, AI Chatbots & Voice Assistants, Mobile App Development (Android and cross-platform), Business Billing Software (16 Indian industry verticals), Digital Marketing & Branding, AI Consulting, Cloud & DevOps Solutions and Cyber Security Solutions. A wider catalogue of specialised services (AI engineering, data and analytics, e-commerce, quality engineering, emerging technology, industry solutions and more) is listed under Service catalog."},{"id":"services-ai-engineering","type":"service","title":"AI engineering services","url":"/services/ai-engineering/","keywords":["ai","machine learning","ml","computer vision","generative","mlops","predictive","document ai","llm","knowledge assistant","data engineering","model"],"text":"AI engineering pages cover generative AI applications, AI knowledge assistants, custom ML model development, computer vision, document AI and data extraction, predictive analytics and forecasting, MLOps and model deployment, data engineering and migration, API development and integrations, legacy software modernisation, software testing and QA, UI/UX design and prototyping, and website and software maintenance."},{"id":"services-crm-erp-hrms","type":"service","title":"CRM, ERP and HRMS development","url":"/services/software-development","keywords":["crm","erp","hrms","hr","payroll","enterprise","custom software","internal system","business software"],"text":"GURU AI builds custom CRM, ERP and HRMS systems as part of its Custom Software Development service. Dedicated pages: CRM development (/services/software-development/crm-development), ERP development (/services/software-development/erp-development) and HRMS development (/services/software-development/hrms-development). An internal ERP for a Pune precision manufacturer is published as a case study."},{"id":"services-billing","type":"service","title":"Billing software for 16 industries","url":"/services/billing-software","keywords":["billing","gst","invoice","salon","gym","manufacturing","wholesale","garage","hospital","pharmacy","retail","fashion","textile","jewellery","hotel","restaurant","event","coaching","rental"],"text":"GST-ready billing and management software adapted to 16 industries: salon & spa, gym & fitness studio, manufacturing, wholesale & distributor, automobile garage, hospital & clinic, pharmacy & medical store, retail shop, fashion & apparel, textile & cloth store, jewellery shop, hotel & lodge, restaurant & cafe, event & banquet, coaching & school fee management, and rental business. Industry overviews are on the Industries pages."},{"id":"services-chatbots","type":"service","title":"AI chatbots and voice assistants","url":"/services/chatbots-voice","keywords":["chatbot","bot","assistant","voice","whatsapp","multilingual","lead","hinglish","marathi"],"text":"AI chatbots and voice assistants that answer customers around the clock in English, Hinglish and Roman Marathi, for websites and WhatsApp. They can greet visitors, answer FAQs from information the business approves, collect details needed to help, qualify leads and hand over to a person when judgment is needed. The architecture allows starting with a rule-based assistant and upgrading to advanced AI models without rebuilding."},{"id":"services-mobile","type":"service","title":"Mobile app development","url":"/services/mobile-apps","keywords":["mobile","app","android","ios","cross-platform","play store","application"],"text":"Android and cross-platform mobile apps focused on fast, reliable experiences on the devices customers really own, with offline resilience where it matters and a clear path to the Play Store. GURU AI says honestly when a great mobile website is the smarter first step instead of an app."},{"id":"services-automation","type":"service","title":"AI business automation","url":"/services/ai-automation","keywords":["automation","workflow","rpa","process","integration","automate","approval","notification"],"text":"AI Business Automation finds repetitive loops (daily reports compiled by hand, forgotten follow-ups, data typed from one system into another) and closes them. It starts by mapping the actual workflows, then automates the highest-impact pieces first: customer follow-ups, report generation, reminders, data syncing and document creation. A workflow audit, automated follow-ups, smart reminders and alerts, and AI-assisted processing are included. Specialised automation topics (BPA, RPA, no-code/low-code, orchestration, approvals and notifications) are listed under the Service catalog."},{"id":"tech-stack","type":"technology","title":"Technology stack and approach","url":"/services/","keywords":["technology","tech stack","stack","framework","language","react","node","python","java","flutter","database","cloud","aws","azure","which technology","kaunsi technology"],"text":"GURU AI does not publish a fixed technology list on its website: the stack is chosen per project based on the requirement, and a realistic scope is agreed before work starts. What the website states: websites are mobile-first, production-ready, with security headers and structured data; the GURU AI billing product grew from a Python and Tkinter application; mobile work covers Android and cross-platform apps; cloud and DevOps work includes CI/CD, containers, infrastructure as code, monitoring and cloud migration; chatbots can start rule-based and upgrade to AI models. For a specific technology question, the team can answer on WhatsApp or email."},{"id":"tech-ai","type":"technology","title":"AI and machine learning approach","url":"/services/ai-consulting","keywords":["ai","machine learning","ml","llm","openai","generative","model","artificial intelligence"],"text":"GURU AI adds AI to existing websites and businesses without a full rebuild: chatbots, automation or smart features. AI consulting helps decide where AI is genuinely useful. AI engineering covers generative AI applications, knowledge assistants, custom ML models, computer vision, document AI, predictive analytics and MLOps."},{"id":"page:about.html","type":"page","title":"About GURU AI TECHNOLOGIES | Pune Based Software & AI Studio","url":"/about","keywords":[],"text":"GURU AI TECHNOLOGIES is a Pune-based software and AI studio building websites, custom software, billing systems and AI tools for businesses in India and abroad. Headline: Built around people. Engineered for business.. Covers: Websites that work harder.; Software that fits your day.; Helpful answers. Fewer delays.; Bring intelligence into the workflow.; Founder & CEO; Managing Director; A scope before a quote.; Talk to the people building it.; Real workflows, real testing.; Your data stays yours.; Progress you can follow.."},{"id":"page:case-studies/accusize.html","type":"page","title":"Accusize Gauges & Tools Case Study","url":"/case-studies/accusize","keywords":[],"text":"See how GURU AI built a website, internal ERP and calibration tracking system for Accusize Gauges & Tools, a precision manufacturer in Pune. Headline: Precision in products. Clarity in operations.. Covers: A professional public website; An ERP around manufacturing; Dedicated calibration tracking; A clearer presence for buyers; Connected operational tracking; Calibration records in context; Software shaped around the work."},{"id":"page:case-studies/billing-software-gat.html","type":"page","title":"Custom Billing Software Case Study","url":"/case-studies/billing-software-gat","keywords":[],"text":"How GURU AI rebuilt its Python and Tkinter billing app into GST-ready billing software with inventory tracking and daily reporting. Headline: From a billing tool. To a business foundation.. Covers: GST-ready invoicing; Inventory tracking; Clear daily reporting; A complete application rewrite; Core capabilities brought together; A foundation for industry-specific systems; Advice grounded in internal use."},{"id":"page:case-studies/index.html","type":"page","title":"Software & AI Case Studies","url":"/case-studies/","keywords":[],"text":"Explore GURU AI project stories: manufacturing websites and ERP, salon AI chatbots, and GST-ready billing software. See the challenges, scope and solutions. Headline: Real businesses. Thoughtful software.. Covers: Precision outside. Connected operations inside.; A front desk that stays available after hours.; Built from experience at the billing counter.; What happens today?; What matters first?; What must connect?; What comes next?."},{"id":"page:case-studies/salon-ai-chatbot.html","type":"page","title":"Salon + AI Chatbot Case Study","url":"/case-studies/salon-ai-chatbot","keywords":[],"text":"Explore how GURU AI paired mobile-first websites with the MR.COOL AI chatbot for Pune salons, supporting service enquiries and appointment conversations. Headline: The salon closes. The conversation continues.. Covers: A premium mobile-first website; MR.COOL, built into the experience; A natural next step on WhatsApp; A more professional first impression; Help beyond opening hours; Fewer missed enquiry opportunities; A reusable engine across salon clients."},{"id":"page:index.html","type":"page","title":"AI Website & Software Development Company Pune","url":"/","keywords":[],"text":"AI company in India building AI-powered websites, custom software, AI chatbots and business automation. Software development company based in Pune. Headline: Websites, business software & AI automation. Covers: AI automation; AI-powered websites; Billing & inventory; Custom software; Chatbots & voice assistants; Mobile app development; E-commerce platforms; CRM development; BI & analytics dashboards; Cloud & DevOps; Cyber security; Digital marketing & branding. Q: How much does a website or software project cost? A: Every business is different, so we don't publish fixed prices. Share your requirements on WhatsApp or through the form below and we'll send a clear, custom quote, usually within 24 hours. Q: How long does a typical project take? A: A premium business website usually takes 1 to 3 weeks. Custom software, apps, and automation projects are scoped individually, you'll get a realistic timeline before we start, and honest updates throughout. Q: Will my website work well on mobile? A: Yes, we design mobile-first. Every project is tested on real phone, tablet, and desktop sizes with no broken layouts, no horizontal scrolling, and fast loading even on 4G."},{"id":"page:industries/beauty-wellness.html","type":"page","title":"Software for Salons, Spas & Fitness Studios","url":"/industries/beauty-wellness","keywords":[],"text":"Billing, AI chatbots, websites, and automation built for salons, spas, and fitness studios, everything we build for the beauty and wellness industry, in one place. Headline: Software built for how salons, spas, and fitness studios actually run. Covers: Salon & Spa Billing Software; Gym & Fitness Studio Billing Software; AI Chatbots & Voice Assistants; AI-Powered Websites; AI Business Automation; Digital Marketing & Branding. Q: Can it handle multiple stylists or therapists billing at the same time? A: Yes. Multiple counters can bill at once with role based access for staff, managers, and owners, the same system we already run for multi chair salons. Q: Does it track membership expiry and renewals for gyms? A: Yes. Membership billing comes with automatic renewal reminders and attendance tracking, so members stay active and your front desk stops chasing payments manually. Q: Can the AI chatbot take bookings outside business hours? A: Yes. The chatbot answers questions and guides customers toward booking at any hour, even late at night, and hands off to a real person on WhatsApp when needed."},{"id":"page:industries/education-services.html","type":"page","title":"Software for Coaching Classes & Rentals","url":"/industries/education-services","keywords":[],"text":"Fee management, billing and automation for coaching classes, schools and rental businesses: what GURU AI builds for education and local services. Headline: Software built for how coaching classes, schools, and rental businesses actually run. Covers: Coaching & School Fee Management Software; Rental Business Billing Software; AI-Powered Websites; AI Business Automation; AI Chatbots & Voice Assistants; Digital Marketing & Branding. Q: Can it send automatic fee reminders to parents? A: Yes. Installment schedules, automatic fee reminders, and clear student records mean collecting fees does not mean chasing parents by phone. Q: Does it track security deposits and return dates for rentals? A: Yes. Rental duration tracking, security deposits, and automatic return date reminders are built in for equipment, vehicle, and furniture rental businesses. Q: Can it handle admissions or booking enquiries automatically? A: An AI chatbot can answer common questions about fees, batches, or availability at any hour, and hand off to a real person when needed."},{"id":"page:industries/healthcare.html","type":"page","title":"Software for Clinics & Pharmacies","url":"/industries/healthcare","keywords":[],"text":"Billing, patient records, AI chatbots, and automation built for clinics, hospitals, and pharmacies, everything we build for the healthcare industry, in one place. Headline: Software built for how clinics, hospitals, and pharmacies actually run. Covers: Hospital & Clinic Management Software; Pharmacy & Medical Store Billing Software; AI Chatbots & Voice Assistants; AI-Powered Websites; AI Business Automation; Cyber Security Solutions. Q: Is patient data kept private and secure? A: Yes. Patient records stay private and organised, and we build with security by default, hardened access controls and safe data handling as standard, not an afterthought. Q: Does it track medicine batch and expiry for pharmacies? A: Yes. Medicine batch and expiry tracking is built into every bill, with low stock and near expiry alerts before they become a compliance problem. Q: Can patients book appointments without calling the front desk? A: Yes. An AI chatbot can answer common questions and guide patients toward booking at any hour, so your front desk spends less time on the phone."},{"id":"page:industries/hospitality-events.html","type":"page","title":"Software for Hotels, Restaurants & Events","url":"/industries/hospitality-events","keywords":[],"text":"Billing, AI chatbots, and websites built for hotels, restaurants, and event venues, everything we build for the hospitality industry, in one place. Headline: Software built for how hotels, restaurants, and event venues actually run. Covers: Hotel & Lodge Billing Software; Restaurant & Cafe Billing Software; Event & Banquet Hall Booking Software; AI-Powered Websites; AI Chatbots & Voice Assistants; Digital Marketing & Branding. Q: Can it show real time room availability for a hotel? A: Yes. Real time room availability, check in and check out billing, and clear folio tracking are built in for small hotels and lodges. Q: Does it handle table wise ordering for a busy restaurant? A: Yes. Table wise ordering, kitchen order tickets, and fast billing keep orders moving from table to kitchen to bill without confusion during the rush. Q: Can it track advance payments for event bookings? A: Yes. A clear booking calendar, advance payment tracking, and guest count based billing are built for banquet halls and event venues."},{"id":"page:industries/index.html","type":"page","title":"Industries We Serve","url":"/industries/","keywords":[],"text":"Explore software and AI for healthcare, retail, hospitality, beauty, manufacturing and education. Find websites, billing and automation for your industry. Headline: Your industry. Your workflow. Your kind of software.. Covers: Healthcare; Retail & Fashion; Hospitality & Events; Beauty & Wellness; Manufacturing & Trade; Education & Local Services; A stronger online presence; More useful conversations; Tools around your workflow; Your business; Your workflow; Your priority."},{"id":"page:industries/manufacturing-trade.html","type":"page","title":"Software for Manufacturers & Distributors","url":"/industries/manufacturing-trade","keywords":[],"text":"ERP, billing, and automation built for manufacturers, distributors, and workshops, everything we build for manufacturing and trade businesses, in one place. Headline: Software built for manufacturers, distributors, and workshops that run on precision. Covers: Manufacturing Management Software; Wholesale & Distributor Billing Software; Automobile Garage Billing Software; ERP Development; AI Business Automation; Cloud & DevOps Solutions. Q: Can it track raw material through multiple production stages? A: Yes. Raw material tracking, production stages, and GST billing are connected in one system, the same approach we built for Accusize Gauges and Tools. Q: Does it support tiered pricing for bulk or wholesale orders? A: Yes. Tiered pricing by quantity, bulk order billing, and dispatch tracking are built in for wholesalers and distributors who move high volumes. Q: We already have an ERP, can you extend it instead of replacing it? A: Usually yes. We review what you have first and extend or integrate where it makes sense, rather than forcing a rebuild you do not need."},{"id":"page:industries/retail-fashion.html","type":"page","title":"Software for Retail, Fashion & Jewellery","url":"/industries/retail-fashion","keywords":[],"text":"Billing, websites, and marketing built for retail shops, fashion stores, and jewellers, everything we build for retail and fashion businesses, in one place. Headline: Software built for how retail, fashion, and jewellery businesses actually sell. Covers: Retail / Shop Billing Software; Fashion & Apparel Retail Billing Software; Textile & Cloth Store Billing Software; Jewellery Shop Billing Software; AI-Powered Websites; Digital Marketing & Branding. Q: Can it handle multiple branches with shared stock visibility? A: Yes. Multi branch stock visibility and consistent billing across locations is exactly what we built for MAAAX Men's Hub, a multi branch fashion retail chain in Pune. Q: Does it track size, colour, and variant level stock? A: Yes. Size, colour, and variant level stock tracking with fast counter billing is built in, the same approach behind the Rangrez cloth store build. Q: Can it handle live gold and silver rate billing for jewellery? A: Yes. Live gold and silver rate billing with making charges and wastage percentage built in is a dedicated part of the jewellery billing software."},{"id":"page:legal/cookies.html","type":"page","title":"Cookie Policy, GURU AI TECHNOLOGIES","url":"/legal/cookies","keywords":[],"text":"What cookies this website uses, and the tracking it deliberately avoids. Headline: Cookie Policy."},{"id":"page:legal/privacy.html","type":"page","title":"Privacy Policy, GURU AI TECHNOLOGIES","url":"/legal/privacy","keywords":[],"text":"How GURU AI TECHNOLOGIES collects, uses, and protects your information. Headline: Privacy Policy."},{"id":"page:legal/terms.html","type":"page","title":"Terms & Conditions, GURU AI TECHNOLOGIES","url":"/legal/terms","keywords":[],"text":"The terms that govern use of the GURU AI TECHNOLOGIES website and services. Headline: Terms & Conditions."},{"id":"page:services/ai-automation.html","type":"page","title":"AI Automation Services, GURU AI TECHNOLOGIES","url":"/services/ai-automation","keywords":[],"text":"AI automation that eliminates repetitive work, follow-ups, reports, data entry, so your team focuses on growth. Built by an AI company in India. Headline: Give your team their hours back.. Covers: Decide what starts it; Build the routine; Give people a review point; What to share with us; Workflow Audit; Automated Follow-Ups; Report Generation; Data Sync & Entry; Smart Reminders & Alerts; AI-Assisted Processing. Q: Which tasks should we automate first? A: The ones that are frequent, rule-based, and boring. Our workflow audit identifies the highest return-on-effort candidates — usually follow-ups and reporting. Q: Will automation replace my staff? A: No — it removes the robotic parts of their day so they can do the human parts better. Teams usually love it once the boring work disappears. Q: What tools do you use? A: Whatever fits: custom scripts, n8n workflows, WhatsApp APIs, AI models, or Cloudflare Workers. Recommendations always come after understanding your setup."},{"id":"page:services/ai-consulting.html","type":"page","title":"AI Consulting, GURU AI TECHNOLOGIES","url":"/services/ai-consulting","keywords":[],"text":"A clear, honest roadmap for where AI fits your business, and where it doesn Headline: Know what's worth building before you spend a rupee.. Covers: A map of the work; A short list of options; A test you can review; What to share with us; Workflow & Opportunity Audit; Prioritized AI Roadmap; Honest Feasibility Checks; Tool & Model Selection; Data Readiness Review; Implementation Partnership. Q: What does a consulting engagement look like? A: Typically: a discovery call, a workflow audit, then a written roadmap presented and discussed — from days to a few weeks depending on business size. Q: We're a small business — is AI even relevant? A: Often yes, in unglamorous ways: automated follow-ups, faster quotes, a chatbot for repeated questions. Small businesses frequently see the fastest payback. Q: Will you just recommend building things with you? A: No — the roadmap stands on its own and you can take it anywhere. Many clients do build with us, but the advice is honest either way."},{"id":"page:services/ai-engineering/ai-knowledge-assistants.html","type":"page","title":"AI Knowledge Assistants","url":"/services/ai-engineering/ai-knowledge-assistants","keywords":[],"text":"AI knowledge assistants grounded in your company documents, policies and manuals, with source references and access controls. Covers: Useful starting points; Choose the source material; Show where the answer came from; Handle missing information; What to share with us; Make internal guidance easier to find; Find the relevant part of a manual; Support the first conversation; Content preparation; Grounded answers; Access and handover; Evaluation and feedback."},{"id":"page:services/ai-engineering/api-development-integrations.html","type":"page","title":"API Development & Integrations","url":"/services/ai-engineering/api-development-integrations","keywords":[],"text":"API development and integrations connecting business software, payment gateways, accounting tools and third-party services. Covers: Useful starting points; Map the information; Build the connection; Prepare for failures; What to share with us; Connect customer and order information; Handle payment events consistently; Expose a documented business API; API design; Third-party connections; Reliability controls; Documentation and handover."},{"id":"page:services/ai-engineering/computer-vision-solutions.html","type":"page","title":"Computer Vision Solutions","url":"/services/ai-engineering/computer-vision-solutions","keywords":[],"text":"Computer vision development for visual inspection, object detection, counting and monitoring, evaluated on representative images and video. Covers: Useful starting points; Capture examples from the real setting; Choose the decision it supports; Check errors before rollout; What to share with us; Flag visible product or packaging issues; Count objects at a controlled checkpoint; Find visual events worth checking; Capture assessment; Detection and classification; Operational integration; Field evaluation."},{"id":"page:services/ai-engineering/custom-ml-model-development.html","type":"page","title":"Custom ML Model Development","url":"/services/ai-engineering/custom-ml-model-development","keywords":[],"text":"Custom machine learning development covering data preparation, baselines, training, evaluation and integration for defined business use cases. Covers: Useful starting points; Define a specific prediction; Prepare examples and a comparison; Decide how to use the result; What to share with us; Route business records to the right queue; Rank items for a defined decision; Surface unusual operational patterns; Problem and data definition; Training and experiments; Evaluation and error analysis; Integration readiness."},{"id":"page:services/ai-engineering/data-engineering-migration.html","type":"page","title":"Data Engineering & Migration","url":"/services/ai-engineering/data-engineering-migration","keywords":[],"text":"Data engineering and migration for cleaning, consolidating and moving business data, with transformation pipelines and reconciliation checks. Covers: Useful starting points; Understand the source; Plan the transfer; Reconcile the result; What to share with us; Move records into a new business system; Bring data into a consistent reporting layer; Resolve inconsistencies before they spread; Source and schema mapping; Cleaning and transformation; Pipelines and migration; Reconciliation."},{"id":"page:services/ai-engineering/document-ai-data-extraction.html","type":"page","title":"Document AI & Data Extraction","url":"/services/ai-engineering/document-ai-data-extraction","keywords":[],"text":"Document AI and data extraction for invoices, forms, receipts and PDFs, with validation rules and human review workflows. Covers: Useful starting points; Choose the fields; Check the values; Send approved data onward; What to share with us; Review supplier invoices in one place; Turn application forms into structured records; Consolidate receipts and supporting documents; Document intake; Structured extraction; Validation and review; System integration."},{"id":"page:services/ai-engineering/generative-ai-applications.html","type":"page","title":"Generative AI Applications","url":"/services/ai-engineering/generative-ai-applications","keywords":[],"text":"Generative AI application development for content drafting, document workflows and assisted editing, with evaluation and user review controls. Covers: Useful starting points; Choose a useful drafting task; Make editing part of the screen; Test quality with examples; What to share with us; Create a focused drafting assistant; Summarise for a defined audience; Turn unstructured input into a usable draft; Workflow and interface; Model integration; Quality controls; Operational visibility."},{"id":"page:services/ai-engineering/index.html","type":"page","title":"AI & Engineering Services","url":"/services/ai-engineering/","keywords":[],"text":"Explore 13 specialist AI and engineering services: knowledge assistants, document AI, computer vision, machine learning, integrations, QA and product design. Headline: Build intelligence. Connect what comes next.. Covers: People need information; Tools need to share records; An existing application needs work; What to share with us; AI Knowledge Assistants; Document AI & Data Extraction; Computer Vision Solutions; Predictive Analytics & Forecasting; Custom ML Model Development; MLOps & AI Model Deployment; Generative AI Applications; API Development & Integrations."},{"id":"page:services/ai-engineering/legacy-software-modernisation.html","type":"page","title":"Legacy Software Modernisation","url":"/services/ai-engineering/legacy-software-modernisation","keywords":[],"text":"Legacy software modernisation for older applications, interfaces, databases and workflows, with staged migration and regression testing. Covers: Useful starting points; Map what people rely on; Plan changes in stages; Compare old and new results; What to share with us; Improve a difficult daily workflow; Upgrade one part at a time; Prepare a controlled application migration; System assessment; Staged architecture; Data and compatibility; Regression and rollout."},{"id":"page:services/ai-engineering/mlops-ai-model-deployment.html","type":"page","title":"MLOps & AI Model Deployment","url":"/services/ai-engineering/mlops-ai-model-deployment","keywords":[],"text":"MLOps and AI deployment services for model serving, versioning, monitoring, release workflows and ongoing operational management. Covers: Useful starting points; Make the model available; Record and review releases; Watch behaviour after release; What to share with us; Make a trained model available to an application; Run repeatable scheduled scoring; Make updates easier to review; Serving architecture; Versioned releases; Monitoring; Retraining workflows."},{"id":"page:services/ai-engineering/predictive-analytics-forecasting.html","type":"page","title":"Predictive Analytics & Forecasting","url":"/services/ai-engineering/predictive-analytics-forecasting","keywords":[],"text":"Predictive analytics and forecasting for demand, stock planning and customer churn, with backtesting and practical business integration. Covers: Useful starting points; Define the question and time period; Check against known periods; Fit the result into a decision; What to share with us; Estimate demand at a useful level; Prioritise customers for review; Prepare for changing operational demand; Data readiness; Baseline comparison; Backtesting; Decision integration."},{"id":"page:services/ai-engineering/software-testing-qa.html","type":"page","title":"Software Testing & QA","url":"/services/ai-engineering/software-testing-qa","keywords":[],"text":"Software testing and QA services covering functional checks, test automation, regression testing and performance assessment. Covers: Useful starting points; Choose important user journeys; Record issues people can reproduce; Repeat checks when software changes; What to share with us; Check the journeys a user depends on; Keep important behaviour under review; Understand behaviour under agreed load; Test planning; Functional and exploratory checks; Focused automation; Performance assessment."},{"id":"page:services/ai-engineering/ui-ux-design-product-prototyping.html","type":"page","title":"UI/UX Design & Product Prototyping","url":"/services/ai-engineering/ui-ux-design-product-prototyping","keywords":[],"text":"UI/UX design and product prototyping for user flows, accessible interfaces and interactive product concepts before development. Covers: Useful starting points; Map the steps users take; Design and link the screens; Review on suitable devices; What to share with us; Make an early concept concrete; Remove friction from a key task; Carry design intent into implementation; User and task discovery; Flows and wireframes; Interface and prototype; Review and developer handover."},{"id":"page:services/ai-engineering/website-software-maintenance.html","type":"page","title":"Website & Software Maintenance","url":"/services/ai-engineering/website-software-maintenance","keywords":[],"text":"Website and software maintenance covering agreed updates, fixes, monitoring and ongoing technical support. Covers: Useful starting points; Agree what to maintain; Plan and test changes; Keep track of issues and updates; What to share with us; Keep regular changes organised; Give reported issues a defined path; Review the foundations around the product; Initial assessment; Planned updates; Monitoring and incidents; Release and recovery."},{"id":"page:services/ai-websites.html","type":"page","title":"AI Website Development Company in Pune, GURU AI TECHNOLOGIES","url":"/services/ai-websites","keywords":[],"text":"AI website development with built-in AI assistants, smart booking, and conversion-focused design. Premium, high-performance websites from an AI company in India. Headline: Websites that work like your best salesperson, 24 hours a day.. Covers: Pages people can find; One enquiry path; An assistant for common questions; What to share with us; Premium Custom Design; Built-In AI Assistant; WhatsApp Booking Integration; SEO & Schema Foundations; 95+ Performance Target; Security & Reliability. Q: How long does a website take? A: Most business websites are delivered in 1–3 weeks depending on scope. You'll see live previews throughout — never a black box. Q: Do I need to provide the content? A: We help with copywriting, structure, and image guidance. You bring your business knowledge; we shape it into content that converts. Q: Will I be able to update it myself? A: Yes — we structure content so routine updates are simple, and our maintenance plans cover everything else."},{"id":"page:services/billing-software/automobile-garage-billing-software.html","type":"page","title":"Garage & Service Center Billing Software","url":"/services/billing-software/automobile-garage-billing-software","keywords":[],"text":"Job card tracking with spare parts and labour billed together, so every invoice matches the work order exactly, with no manual recalculation at the counter. Headline: Job cards, spare parts, and invoices that match what was actually done. Covers: Open the job; Record parts and labour; Close and look back; What to share with us; Job Card Management; Spare Parts Inventory; Labour & Parts Billing; Vehicle Service History; Estimate to Invoice; GST Ready Billing. Q: Can billing be generated directly from a job card? A: Yes. Once a job is marked complete, the job card converts straight into an accurate invoice. Q: Does it track spare parts inventory? A: Yes. Parts used on any job update stock automatically, with alerts when reorder levels are reached. Q: Can we keep a service history per vehicle? A: Yes. Every vehicle&#x27;s past jobs, parts, and invoices are on record for faster future service."},{"id":"page:services/billing-software/coaching-school-fee-management-software.html","type":"page","title":"Coaching & School Fee Management Software","url":"/services/billing-software/coaching-school-fee-management-software","keywords":[],"text":"Installment schedules, automatic fee reminders, and clear student records, so collecting fees doesn&#x27;t mean chasing parents by phone. Headline: Fee collection and reminders, without the awkward follow ups. Covers: Set up fees by batch or class; Record payments and receipts; Manage reminders; What to share with us; Installment Scheduling; Automatic Fee Reminders; Student & Batch Records; Payment History; Multiple Payment Modes; Fee Collection Reports. Q: Can it send fee reminders automatically? A: Yes. Parents are reminded ahead of due dates, cutting down on manual follow up calls. Q: Can it handle installment based fee structures? A: Yes. Installment schedules are set up once and tracked automatically from there. Q: Can we see which students have overdue fees instantly? A: Yes. A clear report shows collected, pending, and overdue fees at any time."},{"id":"page:services/billing-software/event-banquet-booking-software.html","type":"page","title":"Event & Banquet Hall Booking Software","url":"/services/billing-software/event-banquet-booking-software","keywords":[],"text":"Booking calendar, advance payment tracking and guest-count billing, built for banquet halls and event venues. Headline: Event bookings, advances, and final bills, without double booking a date. Covers: See availability; Track advances and packages; Prepare the closing bill; What to share with us; Event Booking Calendar; Advance Payment Tracking; Guest Count Based Billing; Package & Add On Management; Client Communication Log; GST Ready Invoicing. Q: Can it prevent double booking of the same date? A: Yes. The booking calendar shows real time availability, so a date can&#x27;t be booked twice by mistake. Q: Can advance payments be tracked separately from the final bill? A: Yes. Advances are recorded against each booking and adjusted automatically in the final invoice. Q: Can billing be based on final guest count? A: Yes. Catering and service charges can be billed according to the confirmed guest count."},{"id":"page:services/billing-software/fashion-apparel-retail-billing-software.html","type":"page","title":"Fashion & Apparel Retail Billing Software","url":"/services/billing-software/fashion-apparel-retail-billing-software","keywords":[],"text":"Multi branch stock visibility and consistent billing, the same approach behind our MAAAX Men&#x27;s Hub build for a Pune fashion retail chain. Headline: One billing system across every branch of your fashion store. Covers: Organise stock by variant; Keep branch movements visible; Handle exchanges clearly; What to share with us; Multi Branch Stock Visibility; Consistent Pricing & Promotions; Barcode & Size Billing; Branch Wise Reports; Stock Transfer Between Branches; GST Ready Invoicing. Q: Have you built this for a multi branch retailer before? A: Yes. We built the website for MAAAX Men&#x27;s Hub, a multi branch men&#x27;s fashion retail chain operating across Pune. Q: Can stock be transferred between branches easily? A: Yes. Transfers between branches are tracked clearly, so stock counts stay accurate everywhere. Q: Do all branches see the same pricing and promotions? A: Yes. Pricing and promotions can be managed centrally and pushed to every branch at once."},{"id":"page:services/billing-software/gym-fitness-studio-billing-software.html","type":"page","title":"Gym & Fitness Studio Billing Software","url":"/services/billing-software/gym-fitness-studio-billing-software","keywords":[],"text":"Membership billing with automatic renewal reminders and attendance tracking, so members stay active and your front desk stops chasing payments manually. Headline: Memberships, renewals, and attendance, without the spreadsheet. Covers: Set up the plans; Connect payments and dates; Track attendance and renewals; What to share with us; Membership Billing; Automatic Renewal Reminders; Attendance Tracking; Trainer & Class Scheduling; Multiple Plan Types; Revenue & Retention Reports. Q: Does it send renewal reminders automatically? A: Yes. Members are reminded before their membership expires, reducing silent lapses and lost revenue. Q: Can it track attendance and inactive members? A: Yes. Check ins are logged, and the system can flag members who haven&#x27;t visited in a while. Q: Can it handle personal training packages alongside regular memberships? A: Yes. Multiple plan types, including personal training packages, can run in the same system."},{"id":"page:services/billing-software/hospital-clinic-management-software.html","type":"page","title":"Hospital & Clinic Management Software","url":"/services/billing-software/hospital-clinic-management-software","keywords":[],"text":"A front desk tool built for clinics: book appointments, keep patient records private and organised, and generate bills without the usual paperwork pile. Headline: Appointment, patient record, and billing in one clean system. Covers: Book and find an appointment; Separate access by role; Keep charges with the visit; What to share with us; Appointment Scheduling; Patient Records; Consultation & Procedure Billing; Role Based Access; Daily Collection Reports; Data Privacy Controls. Q: Is patient data kept private and secure? A: Yes. Access is role based and every record is permission controlled, so only authorised staff can view sensitive details. Q: Can it handle multiple doctors and schedules? A: Yes. Each doctor gets their own calendar, and the front desk can manage all of them from one screen. Q: Can it bill for procedures and pharmacy items together? A: Yes. Consultation fees, procedures, and pharmacy or lab charges can all be combined into a single clean invoice."},{"id":"page:services/billing-software/hotel-lodge-billing-software.html","type":"page","title":"Hotel & Lodge Booking and Billing Software","url":"/services/billing-software/hotel-lodge-billing-software","keywords":[],"text":"Real time room availability, check in and check out billing, and clear folio tracking, built for small hotels and lodges that need reliability over complexity. Headline: Room bookings and billing that stay in sync, always. Covers: Track reservations and room status; Record charges as they happen; Review the checkout bill; What to share with us; Real Time Room Availability; Check In & Check Out Billing; Guest Folio Tracking; Advance & Deposit Handling; Booking Calendar; GST Ready Invoicing. Q: Does it prevent double bookings? A: Yes. Room availability updates in real time, so every booking reflects the true current status. Q: Can it track charges added during a guest&#x27;s stay? A: Yes. Room service, amenities, and other charges are added to a running folio, settled at check out. Q: Can advance payments be recorded against a booking? A: Yes. Advances and deposits are recorded cleanly and adjusted automatically against the final bill."},{"id":"page:services/billing-software/jewellery-shop-billing-software.html","type":"page","title":"Jewellery Shop Billing Software","url":"/services/billing-software/jewellery-shop-billing-software","keywords":[],"text":"Live gold and silver rate billing with making charges and wastage percentage built in, the same approach we delivered for भवरिलाल जुगराज फुलफगर सराफ & ज्वेलर्स. Headline: Making charges, purity, and gold rate billing, handled correctly. Covers: Record the item and rate; Apply your pricing rules; Keep a readable bill history; What to share with us; Live Rate Billing; Making Charges & Wastage; Purity & Hallmark Records; Old Gold Exchange; Scheme & Advance Tracking; GST Compliant Invoicing. Q: Have you built jewellery billing software before? A: Yes. We delivered a premium jewellery website and billing approach for भवरिलाल जुगराज फुलफगर सराफ & ज्वेलर्स in Maharashtra. Q: Can it handle daily changing gold rates? A: Yes. The day&#x27;s rate can be updated once and applied automatically across every bill generated that day. Q: Does it calculate making charges and wastage automatically? A: Yes. Making charges and wastage percentage are calculated per item, removing manual calculation errors."},{"id":"page:services/billing-software/manufacturing-management-software.html","type":"page","title":"Manufacturing Management Software","url":"/services/billing-software/manufacturing-management-software","keywords":[],"text":"Raw material tracking, production stages, and GST billing connected in one system, built from real precision manufacturing work for Accusize Gauges & Tools. Headline: Production, inventory, and billing that finally talk to each other. Covers: Record raw materials; Show work in progress; Connect finished items to billing; What to share with us; Raw Material Inventory; Production Stage Tracking; Quality Check Records; Finished Goods Billing; Vendor & Purchase Management; Production Reports. Q: Have you built this for a real manufacturer before? A: Yes. We built the website and an internal ERP and business management system for Accusize Gauges & Tools, a precision gauge manufacturer in Pune. Q: Can it track raw materials through to finished goods? A: Yes. Material intake, production stages, and finished goods are all linked, so stock and billing stay accurate. Q: Does it support quality check records? A: Yes. Quality checks can be logged against batches with a clear pass or fail history for audits and customers."},{"id":"page:services/billing-software/pharmacy-medical-store-billing-software.html","type":"page","title":"Pharmacy & Medical Store Billing Software","url":"/services/billing-software/pharmacy-medical-store-billing-software","keywords":[],"text":"Medicine batch and expiry tracking built into every bill, with low stock and near expiry alerts before they become a compliance problem. Headline: Batch, expiry, and GST billing, without the risk of a mix up. Covers: Record batches at receipt; Show batch details at the counter; Review stock that needs attention; What to share with us; Batch & Expiry Tracking; Near Expiry Alerts; Low Stock Alerts; Prescription Linked Billing; Supplier & Purchase Tracking; GST Ready Invoicing. Q: Can it track medicines by batch and expiry? A: Yes. Every item is tracked by batch and expiry date, with bills linked to the correct batch automatically. Q: Will it alert us before stock expires? A: Yes. Near expiry alerts arrive with enough lead time to act, reducing wasted or unsellable stock. Q: Can it link bills to prescriptions? A: Yes, where needed. This keeps a cleaner record for compliance and customer history."},{"id":"page:services/billing-software/rental-business-billing-software.html","type":"page","title":"Rental Business Billing Software","url":"/services/billing-software/rental-business-billing-software","keywords":[],"text":"Rental duration tracking, security deposits, and automatic return date reminders, built for equipment, vehicle, and furniture rental businesses. Headline: Rental billing that tracks dates, deposits, and returns automatically. Covers: Keep a clear booking record; Record charges and deposits; Complete the return; What to share with us; Rental Duration & Rate Billing; Security Deposit Tracking; Automatic Return Reminders; Item Availability Calendar; Condition & Damage Notes; GST Ready Invoicing. Q: Can it track security deposits separately from rental charges? A: Yes. Deposits are recorded against each booking and settled cleanly once the item is returned. Q: Does it send reminders before a return date? A: Yes. Customers are reminded ahead of the due return date, reducing late or forgotten returns. Q: Can it handle different rental periods, daily, weekly, or custom? A: Yes. Rates can be set for daily, weekly, or custom rental periods depending on your business."},{"id":"page:services/billing-software/restaurant-cafe-billing-software.html","type":"page","title":"Restaurant & Cafe Billing Software","url":"/services/billing-software/restaurant-cafe-billing-software","keywords":[],"text":"Table wise ordering, kitchen order tickets, and fast billing, so orders move from table to kitchen to bill without confusion during the rush. Headline: Order to bill, without the kitchen slowing down. Covers: Enter orders by table; Send the preparation details; Close the bill; What to share with us; Table Wise Ordering; Kitchen Order Tickets; Split Bill & Running Tabs; Takeaway & Delivery Billing; Menu & Pricing Control; Daily Sales by Item. Q: Can it print kitchen order tickets automatically? A: Yes. Orders can route straight to a kitchen printer the moment they are placed, with no manual relay needed. Q: Does it handle split bills and running tabs? A: Yes. Bills can be split by item, by person, or kept running for regular customers. Q: Can it manage both dine in and delivery orders? A: Yes. Dine in, takeaway, and delivery each get their own simple flow within the same system."},{"id":"page:services/billing-software/retail-shop-billing-software.html","type":"page","title":"Retail / Shop Billing Software","url":"/services/billing-software/retail-shop-billing-software","keywords":[],"text":"Barcode scanning, live stock tracking, and low stock alerts, so your counter moves fast and you never find out about an empty shelf from a customer. Headline: Counter billing built for busy retail shops. Covers: Prepare your item list; Record sales and returns; Check stock and payments; What to share with us; Barcode Scanning; Live Stock Tracking; Low Stock Alerts; Multiple Payment Modes; Daily Sales Reports; GST Ready Invoicing. Q: Does it support barcode scanners we already own? A: Most standard USB and Bluetooth barcode scanners work directly, no special hardware needed. Q: Can it handle multiple cash counters? A: Yes. Multiple billing counters can run at once, all syncing to the same stock and sales data. Q: What happens if the internet goes down mid sale? A: We can architect for offline first billing with automatic sync once the connection returns."},{"id":"page:services/billing-software/salon-spa-billing-software.html","type":"page","title":"Salon & Spa Billing Software","url":"/services/billing-software/salon-spa-billing-software","keywords":[],"text":"Service billing, package tracking, and staff commission handled automatically, so your front desk spends less time on paperwork and more time with walk-ins. Headline: Billing software your stylists can run between clients. Covers: Set up services and packages; Track visits and balances; Connect staff and sales records; What to share with us; Service & Package Billing; Staff Commission Tracking; Product Inventory; Appointment Linked Billing; Client History; GST Ready Invoices. Q: Can it track prepaid packages and memberships? A: Yes. Package balances update automatically with every visit, and the system flags when a client is close to running out. Q: Does it calculate staff commission? A: Yes. Commission rules can be set per stylist or per service, and totals are ready for payday without manual tracking. Q: Will it work for a multi-chair salon with several staff billing at once? A: Yes. Multiple counters can bill at the same time with role based access for staff, managers, and owners."},{"id":"page:services/billing-software/textile-cloth-store-billing-software.html","type":"page","title":"Textile & Cloth Store Billing Software","url":"/services/billing-software/textile-cloth-store-billing-software","keywords":[],"text":"Size, colour, and variant level stock tracking with fast counter billing, the same approach behind the Rangrez cloth store build for the Maharashtra market. Headline: Billing built for fabric rolls, sizes, and variants. Covers: Separate rolls, pieces, and variants; Record the quantity sold; Check what is still available; What to share with us; Variant & Size Tracking; Billing by Metre or Piece; Season & Collection Tags; Wholesale & Retail Pricing; Stock Ageing Reports; GST Ready Billing. Q: Have you built this for a real cloth store before? A: Yes. We built Rangrez, a premium cloth and fashion store website and system for the Maharashtra market, from scratch. Q: Can it track stock by size and colour separately? A: Yes. Every size and colour variant is tracked as its own stock item, so counts stay accurate. Q: Does it support both wholesale and retail pricing? A: Yes. You can set different pricing tiers depending on the type of buyer at the counter."},{"id":"page:services/billing-software/wholesale-distributor-billing-software.html","type":"page","title":"Wholesale & Distributor Billing Software","url":"/services/billing-software/wholesale-distributor-billing-software","keywords":[],"text":"Tiered pricing by quantity, bulk order billing, and dispatch tracking, built for wholesalers and distributors who move high volumes with tight margins. Headline: Bulk orders, tiered pricing, and dispatch, all in one place. Covers: Set up quantity prices; Track ordered and dispatched quantities; Review invoices and amounts due; What to share with us; Tiered Quantity Pricing; Bulk Order Entry; Dispatch Tracking; Buyer Ledger & Credit Tracking; Stock Across Warehouses; GST Ready Invoicing. Q: Does pricing change automatically based on order quantity? A: Yes. Tiered pricing rules apply automatically, so larger orders are priced correctly without manual work. Q: Can it track dispatch separately from billing? A: Yes. Dispatch status is tracked against each order, so you always know what&#x27;s shipped versus what&#x27;s billed. Q: Can it manage credit terms with regular buyers? A: Yes. Outstanding balances and credit terms are tracked clearly per buyer."},{"id":"page:services/billing-software.html","type":"page","title":"Business Billing Software, GURU AI TECHNOLOGIES","url":"/services/billing-software","keywords":[],"text":"GST-ready invoicing, inventory, and reports built for Indian businesses, simple enough for daily use. Headline: Billing your staff learns in a day. Reports you actually read.. Covers: Set up the items you sell; Handle everyday exceptions; Read the totals at closing; What to share with us; Salon & Spa Billing Software; Hospital & Clinic Management Software; Retail / Shop Billing Software; Restaurant & Cafe Billing Software; Manufacturing Management Software; Jewellery Shop Billing Software; Textile & Cloth Store Billing Software; Fashion & Apparel Retail Billing Software. Q: Is it really GST-compliant? A: Yes — correct rate handling, HSN support, and export formats your accountant can work with directly. Q: Can my existing data be imported? A: Usually yes — products, customers, and opening stock can be migrated from spreadsheets or most existing systems. Q: Does it work offline? A: We can architect for offline-first counter billing with sync — tell us about your connectivity and we'll design for reality."},{"id":"page:services/chatbots-voice.html","type":"page","title":"AI Chatbot Development, GURU AI TECHNOLOGIES","url":"/services/chatbots-voice","keywords":[],"text":"AI chatbot development for 24/7 multilingual assistants that answer customers, capture leads, and book appointments on web and WhatsApp. Headline: Your business, answering instantly, in English, Hinglish, and Marathi.. Covers: Choose what it should know; Set the conversation steps; Make handover clear; What to share with us; Trilingual by Design; Lead Capture & Qualification; WhatsApp Handover; Booking & FAQ Handling; Upgradeable AI Brain; On-Brand Personality. Q: Does it work on WhatsApp too? A: Yes — we build for website chat, WhatsApp, or both. WhatsApp integration uses official APIs for reliability. Q: What happens when the bot doesn't know an answer? A: It says so honestly and routes the customer to you on WhatsApp — no dead ends, no made-up answers. Q: Can it really understand Marathi and Hinglish? A: Yes — it detects Roman-script Marathi and Hinglish automatically and replies in the same language. Try the assistant on this site!"},{"id":"page:services/cloud-devops.html","type":"page","title":"Cloud & DevOps Solutions, GURU AI TECHNOLOGIES","url":"/services/cloud-devops","keywords":[],"text":"Cloudflare, CI/CD, and infrastructure that keeps your product fast, online, and effortless to update. Headline: Deployments so smooth you forget they used to be scary.. Covers: Put release steps in order; Separate testing and live use; Plan for recovery; What to share with us; Cloudflare Pages & Workers; CI/CD Pipelines; Domain, DNS & SSL; Monitoring & Alerts; Backups & Recovery; Cost Optimization. Q: Can you migrate my existing site without downtime? A: Yes — we stage the new setup fully, test it, then switch DNS with effectively zero downtime. Rollback plans included. Q: Why Cloudflare specifically? A: Best-in-class speed, security, and pricing for most business workloads. Where something else fits better, we'll recommend that instead. Q: Do we need DevOps as a small business? A: You need the results: fast site, easy updates, backups. We set it up once, properly — then it mostly runs itself."},{"id":"page:services/cyber-security.html","type":"page","title":"Cyber Security Solutions, GURU AI TECHNOLOGIES","url":"/services/cyber-security","keywords":[],"text":"Website hardening, security audits, and safe-by-design builds that protect your data and reputation. Headline: One breach costs more than years of prevention.. Covers: Review the parts in scope; Explain what to fix first; Check the fixes; What to share with us; Website Security Audit; Hardening & Fixes; Secure-by-Design Builds; Dependency & Code Review; Access & Data Protection; Plain-Language Reporting. Q: We're small — would anyone really attack us? A: Attacks are automated and indiscriminate: bots probe every public website daily. Small businesses are hit constantly precisely because defenses are assumed weak. Q: What does a security audit include? A: Headers, HTTPS configuration, form and input handling, dependency vulnerabilities, and information leakage — delivered as a prioritized, plain-language report. Q: Can you secure a website another developer built? A: Yes — audits and hardening on existing sites are among our most common security engagements. No blame, just fixes."},{"id":"page:services/digital-marketing.html","type":"page","title":"Digital Marketing & Branding, GURU AI TECHNOLOGIES","url":"/services/digital-marketing","keywords":[],"text":"SEO, social presence, and brand identity that make your business discoverable, and memorable. Headline: Be found. Be remembered. Be chosen.. Covers: Make your business easier to understand; Work on the channels that fit; Decide what to track; What to share with us; Local SEO; Google Business Optimization; Brand Identity; Content Strategy; Social Media Presence; Honest Analytics. Q: How long until SEO shows results? A: Local SEO typically shows meaningful movement in 2–4 months. Anyone promising page one in a week is selling something else. Q: Do you run paid ads too? A: Our core strength is organic foundations — SEO, Google Business, content. For paid campaigns we advise on strategy and can coordinate execution. Q: Can you fix my existing brand look? A: Yes — brand refinement is often smarter than reinvention. We'll audit what you have and strengthen it."},{"id":"page:services/index.html","type":"page","title":"Software, Websites & AI Services","url":"/services/","keywords":[],"text":"Websites, custom software, AI automation, chatbots, mobile apps, billing software, marketing, consulting, cloud, and security, all under one roof. Headline: Build what’s next. Simplify what’s everyday.. Covers: Customers cannot find or reach you; Staff repeat work across tools; Customers need answers or self-service; What to share with us; AI Powered Websites; Custom Software Development; Mobile App Development; Billing Software; AI Business Automation; AI Chatbots & Voice; AI Consulting; Digital Marketing & Branding."},{"id":"page:services/mobile-apps.html","type":"page","title":"Mobile App Development, GURU AI TECHNOLOGIES","url":"/services/mobile-apps","keywords":[],"text":"Fast, reliable Android and cross-platform apps that put your business in your customer Headline: Your business, one tap away.. Covers: Start with the main journey; Connect the app to your records; Plan for the devices people use; What to share with us; Android & Cross-Platform; Booking & Ordering Flows; Push Notifications; Offline Resilience; Play Store Delivery; Analytics Built In. Q: Do I need an app or is a website enough? A: Depends on your business. If customers return frequently or need notifications, an app shines. If not, a great mobile website may be smarter — we'll advise honestly. Q: iOS as well as Android? A: Our focus is Android and cross-platform frameworks that can target iOS. For India-first businesses, Android-first is usually the right call. Q: How long does an app take? A: Typically 4–10 weeks depending on features. You'll get a scoped timeline with your custom quote before we begin."},{"id":"page:services/more_services/automation/approval-notification-automation.html","type":"page","title":"Approval & Notification Automation Services","url":"/services/more_services/automation/approval-notification-automation","keywords":[],"text":"Automating requests, approvals, reminders, and notifications. Explore how GURU AI TECHNOLOGIES can plan and build it for your business. Headline: Approval & Notification Automation. Covers: A practical 