ll-stack-development","keywords":[],"text":"Developing both frontend and backend components. Explore how GURU AI TECHNOLOGIES can plan and build it for your business. Headline: Full-Stack Development. Covers: A practical example; What we can provide; What to share with us; What a first version can include; What we check together; What we can scope together; Understand the work; Agree on a useful first version; Connect the parts; Learn from use."},{"id":"page:services/more_services/web-development/headless-cms-development.html","type":"page","title":"Headless CMS Development Services","url":"/services/more_services/web-development/headless-cms-development","keywords":[],"text":"Separating content management from the website or application displaying that content. Explore how GURU AI TECHNOLOGIES can plan and build it for your busi Headline: Headless CMS Development. Covers: A practical example; What we can provide; What to share with us; What a first version can include; What we check together; What we can scope together; Understand the work; Agree on a useful first version; Connect the parts; Learn from use."},{"id":"page:services/more_services/web-development/landing-page-development.html","type":"page","title":"Landing Page Development Services","url":"/services/more_services/web-development/landing-page-development","keywords":[],"text":"Building focused pages for advertising campaigns, lead generation, and product launches. Explore how GURU AI TECHNOLOGIES can plan and build it for your bu Headline: Landing Page Development. Covers: A practical example; What we can provide; What to share with us; What a first version can include; What we check together; What we can scope together; Understand the work; Agree on a useful first version; Connect the parts; Learn from use."},{"id":"page:services/more_services/web-development/multi-tenant-application-development.html","type":"page","title":"Multi-Tenant Application Development Services","url":"/services/more_services/web-development/multi-tenant-application-development","keywords":[],"text":"Building applications that serve multiple customers using shared infrastructure with appropriate data separation. Explore how GURU AI TECHNOLOGIES can plan Headline: Multi-Tenant Application Development. Covers: A practical example; What we can provide; What to share with us; What a first version can include; What we check together; What we can scope together; Understand the work; Agree on a useful first version; Connect the parts; Learn from use."},{"id":"page:services/more_services/web-development/progressive-web-app-pwa-development.html","type":"page","title":"Progressive Web App (PWA) Development Services","url":"/services/more_services/web-development/progressive-web-app-pwa-development","keywords":[],"text":"Building web applications that offer app-like features on mobile devices. Explore how GURU AI TECHNOLOGIES can plan and build it for your business. Headline: Progressive Web App (PWA) Development. Covers: A practical example; What we can provide; What to share with us; What a first version can include; What we check together; What we can scope together; Understand the work; Agree on a useful first version; Connect the parts; Learn from use."},{"id":"page:services/more_services/web-development/web-application-development.html","type":"page","title":"Web Application Development Services","url":"/services/more_services/web-development/web-application-development","keywords":[],"text":"Building browser-based applications for business operations. Explore how GURU AI TECHNOLOGIES can plan and build it for your business. Headline: Web Application Development. Covers: A practical example; What we can provide; What to share with us; What a first version can include; What we check together; What we can scope together; Understand the work; Agree on a useful first version; Connect the parts; Learn from use."},{"id":"page:services/more_services/web-development/website-accessibility-optimization.html","type":"page","title":"Website Accessibility Optimization Services","url":"/services/more_services/web-development/website-accessibility-optimization","keywords":[],"text":"Making websites more accessible to people with disabilities. Explore how GURU AI TECHNOLOGIES can plan and build it for your business. Headline: Website Accessibility Optimization. Covers: A practical example; What we can provide; What to share with us; What a first version can include; What we check together; What we can scope together; Understand the work; Agree on a useful first version; Connect the parts; Learn from use."},{"id":"page:services/more_services/web-development/website-performance-optimization.html","type":"page","title":"Website Performance Optimization Services","url":"/services/more_services/web-development/website-performance-optimization","keywords":[],"text":"Improving loading speed, responsiveness, and overall website performance. Explore how GURU AI TECHNOLOGIES can plan and build it for your business. Headline: Website Performance Optimization. Covers: A practical example; What we can provide; What to share with us; What a first version can include; What we check together; What we can scope together; Understand the work; Agree on a useful first version; Connect the parts; Learn from use."},{"id":"page:services/more_services/web-development/website-redesign-revamp.html","type":"page","title":"Website Redesign & Revamp Services","url":"/services/more_services/web-development/website-redesign-revamp","keywords":[],"text":"Modernizing an existing website&#x27;s appearance, structure, and usability. Explore how GURU AI TECHNOLOGIES can plan and build it for your business. Headline: Website Redesign & Revamp. Covers: A practical example; What we can provide; What to share with us; What a first version can include; What we check together; What we can scope together; Understand the work; Agree on a useful first version; Connect the parts; Learn from use."},{"id":"page:services/software-development/ai-agents-development.html","type":"page","title":"AI Agents Development","url":"/services/software-development/ai-agents-development","keywords":[],"text":"AI agents that read, reason, and act across multiple steps, built for tasks too complex for a simple chatbot or a single automation rule. Headline: Software that takes the next step on its own, not just answers questions. Covers: Define the steps and tools; Keep important decisions visible; Test realistic situations; What to share with us; Multi Step Task Automation; Document Reading & Data Extraction; Lead Qualification Agents; Tool & System Integration; Human Approval Checkpoints; Activity Logs & Audit Trail. Q: How is this different from the automation you already offer? A: Standard automation follows one fixed path for one trigger. AI agents read context and make decisions across several steps, handling cases that do not fit a single fixed rule. Q: Is this the same as a chatbot? A: No. A chatbot responds to what someone types. An agent can read incoming information and take several actions on its own, with or without a conversation involved. Q: Can it work with our existing CRM or software? A: Yes, agents are built to connect with the systems you already use, including CRM and billing software we build."},{"id":"page:services/software-development/business-intelligence-dashboard-development.html","type":"page","title":"BI & Analytics Dashboard Development","url":"/services/software-development/business-intelligence-dashboard-development","keywords":[],"text":"Sales, stock, and performance numbers pulled from your existing systems into one clear dashboard, instead of five export files nobody has time to compare. Headline: See what's actually happening in your business, in one screen. Covers: Agree on each number; Connect the sources; Build views people can check; What to share with us; Unified Data Dashboard; Automatic Report Refresh; Branch & Location Comparison; Trend & Growth Charts; Custom Alerts; Role Based Views. Q: Do you need access to all our existing software? A: Only read access to pull the numbers, your existing systems keep working exactly as they are, the dashboard sits on top of them. Q: Can this work if our data is spread across different tools? A: Yes, that is the usual situation. We connect to each system individually and bring the numbers together in one dashboard. Q: Do we need a data analyst to use this? A: No. The dashboard is built to be read by an owner or manager directly, charts and numbers presented plainly, not raw data."},{"id":"page:services/software-development/construction-real-estate-billing-software.html","type":"page","title":"Construction & Real Estate Billing Software","url":"/services/software-development/construction-real-estate-billing-software","keywords":[],"text":"Material costs, labour billing, client invoices, and site-wise expense tracking in one system, built for contractors, builders, and real estate developers. Headline: Project costs, billing, and payments that don't fall apart halfway through a build. Covers: Record costs where they belong; Track client invoices; Compare work across sites; What to share with us; Project-Wise Cost Tracking; Client Billing & Milestone Invoices; Material & Vendor Payments; Labour & Site Expense Logging; Budget vs Actual Reports; Multi-Project Dashboard. Q: Can this handle multiple ongoing projects at once? A: Yes, each project is tracked separately with its own costs and billing, alongside a combined view across all active projects. Q: Can site staff log expenses from their phone? A: Yes, a simple mobile friendly entry screen can be included so site staff log costs as they happen, not days later. Q: Does this replace our accountant or CA? A: No, it keeps clean, organised records that make your accountant&rsquo;s job easier, it does not replace statutory filing or compliance work."},{"id":"page:services/software-development/crm-development.html","type":"page","title":"CRM Development","url":"/services/software-development/crm-development","keywords":[],"text":"Lead tracking, pipeline stages, and follow up reminders built around how your team actually sells, not a generic template. Headline: A CRM your sales team will actually open every day. Covers: A clear list of stages; A record for each contact; A place to see pending work; What to share with us; Pipeline Management; Contact & Lead History; Follow Up Reminders; Role Based Access; Integration Ready; Sales Reports. Q: How is this different from off the shelf CRM software? A: Off the shelf CRMs force your process to fit their software. We build the CRM around your actual sales process instead. Q: Can it integrate with WhatsApp? A: Yes. Lead capture and follow ups can connect with WhatsApp and other tools your team already uses. Q: Will my sales team need training? A: Most teams are comfortable within a day, since the system is built around how they already work."},{"id":"page:services/software-development/customer-portal-development.html","type":"page","title":"Customer & Vendor Portal Development","url":"/services/software-development/customer-portal-development","keywords":[],"text":"A self-service portal where customers, vendors, or dealers check orders, invoices, and status themselves, instead of calling your office for every update. Headline: A dedicated login for customers, vendors, or dealers, without the phone calls. Covers: Account access; A useful account page; Connect the office records; What to share with us; Secure Customer or Vendor Login; Order & Status Tracking; Invoice & Payment History; Document Sharing; Request & Approval Workflows; Admin Oversight Dashboard. Q: Is this for customers, vendors, or both? A: Either, or both. The portal can be built for customer self service, vendor and dealer management, or a combination depending on your business. Q: Can it connect to our existing billing or CRM system? A: Yes, the portal is usually connected to the systems that already hold the order, invoice, and customer data, rather than duplicating it. Q: How many users can it support? A: The portal is built to scale from a handful of key accounts to hundreds of customers or vendors, depending on your needs."},{"id":"page:services/software-development/document-management-system.html","type":"page","title":"Document Management System","url":"/services/software-development/document-management-system","keywords":[],"text":"A searchable, permission-controlled home for contracts, records, and business files, built for teams that have outgrown shared folders and email attachments. Headline: Every document, contract, and file, findable in seconds. Covers: Organise files for searching; Set permissions and versions; Make approval steps clear; What to share with us; Centralised Document Storage; Full-Text Search; Version History; Role Based Permissions; Approval Workflows; Expiry & Renewal Alerts. Q: Can this handle different document types, contracts, invoices, HR files? A: Yes, documents are organised by category or project, so contracts, HR records, and invoices can all live in the same system with different access rules. Q: Can we migrate our existing files into it? A: Yes, existing documents from shared drives or folders can be imported and organised into the new structure. Q: Does it integrate with e-signature for contracts? A: E-signature integration can be added, so contracts can be sent for signing and stored automatically once signed."},{"id":"page:services/software-development/ecommerce-platform-development.html","type":"page","title":"E-Commerce Platform Development","url":"/services/software-development/ecommerce-platform-development","keywords":[],"text":"Product catalogue, cart, payments, and order management built around how your business actually sells, not a rented template you can't fully control. Headline: An online store built to actually sell, not just exist. Covers: A catalog customers can navigate; Checkout and payment; An order desk for staff; What to share with us; Product Catalogue & Variants; Secure Checkout & Payments; Order & Fulfilment Tracking; Inventory Sync; Discounts & Coupon Engine; Admin & Sales Dashboard. Q: Do we need a developer to add products or run a sale? A: No. Products, pricing, and discounts are managed from an admin panel, no code or developer needed for day to day changes. Q: Can this connect to our existing billing or inventory software? A: Yes, that is one of the main reasons to build a custom store instead of using a marketplace, stock and orders can sync directly with the systems you already use. Q: What about payment gateway and shipping integration? A: Both are integrated during the build, using the payment gateway and courier partners you already work with or new ones we recommend."},{"id":"page:services/software-development/erp-development.html","type":"page","title":"ERP Development","url":"/services/software-development/erp-development","keywords":[],"text":"Inventory, finance, and operational reporting connected in one system, built from real manufacturing and retail experience. Headline: One system connecting inventory, finance, and reports. Covers: Connected records; Work for each role; Reports you can reconcile; What to share with us; Inventory Management; Finance & Reporting; Multi Tab Dashboards; Purchase & Vendor Tracking; Role Based Access; Custom Reports. Q: Have you built an ERP for a real business before? A: Yes. We built an internal ERP and business management system for Accusize Gauges & Tools, a Pune based precision manufacturer. Q: Can it connect inventory and finance automatically? A: Yes. Stock movement feeds directly into financial reporting, so the numbers always match. Q: Is it suitable for a growing business, not just a large one? A: Yes. We build ERP systems sized to where your business is now, with room to grow."},{"id":"page:services/software-development/fleet-management-software.html","type":"page","title":"Fleet Management Software","url":"/services/software-development/fleet-management-software","keywords":[],"text":"Vehicle tracking, driver records, fuel and maintenance costs, and trip history in one system, built for businesses running delivery, logistics, or a rental fleet. Headline: Know where every vehicle is, and what it's costing you. Covers: Track vehicles and drivers; Log trips and costs; See upcoming work; What to share with us; GPS Vehicle Tracking; Trip & Route History; Fuel & Expense Tracking; Maintenance & Service Alerts; Driver Records & Assignment; Delivery & Dispatch Tracking. Q: Do we need to install special hardware in every vehicle? A: A GPS tracking device is required per vehicle, we can recommend compatible hardware or work with trackers you already have. Q: Can this handle a mixed fleet, like bikes, vans, and trucks? A: Yes, the system tracks whatever vehicle types your fleet actually has, not a format built for one. Q: Can drivers use this from their phone? A: Yes, a simple driver app or mobile view can be included for trip logging and delivery status, separate from the owner&rsquo;s full dashboard."},{"id":"page:services/software-development/helpdesk-support-software.html","type":"page","title":"Help Desk Software","url":"/services/software-development/helpdesk-support-software","keywords":[],"text":"A clean ticketing system for teams that have outgrown managing every customer issue over WhatsApp and phone calls alone. Headline: Support tickets that do not get lost in a WhatsApp chat history. Covers: Capture the request; Assign and track it; Review recurring problems; What to share with us; Ticket Creation & Tracking; Priority & Status Management; Agent Assignment; Customer Reply History; Knowledge Base / FAQ Section; Response Time Reports. Q: Can customers still reach us through WhatsApp? A: Yes. WhatsApp can remain a channel, with messages logged as tickets so nothing gets lost outside the system. Q: How is this different from a shared email inbox? A: A shared inbox has no status, no priority, and no ownership. Tickets make it clear what is open, who owns it, and what happened. Q: Can it track performance across multiple support staff? A: Yes, response times and resolution rates are tracked per agent and as a team."},{"id":"page:services/software-development/hrms-development.html","type":"page","title":"HRMS Development","url":"/services/software-development/hrms-development","keywords":[],"text":"Attendance, leave, payroll, and employee records in one system that gets used every day, not one that gets abandoned after the first month. Headline: HR software your team opens without being told to. Covers: Employee records; Attendance and leave; Payroll preparation; What to share with us; Attendance & Leave Tracking; Payroll Calculation; Employee Self Service; Document & Record Storage; Role Based Access; Multi Branch Reporting. Q: How is this different from a payroll only tool? A: Payroll only tools stop at salary calculation. We build attendance, leave, documents, and payroll together, so the numbers feeding into payroll are already accurate. Q: Can it handle multiple branches or locations? A: Yes. Attendance and leave are tracked per branch, with a combined view for owners and a branch level view for local managers. Q: Do employees need training to use it? A: Most employees only need the self service screen, checking leave balance and payslips, which takes a few minutes to learn."},{"id":"page:services/software-development/inventory-management-software.html","type":"page","title":"Inventory Management","url":"/services/software-development/inventory-management-software","keywords":[],"text":"Real time stock levels, reorder alerts, and warehouse locations, built for businesses that are tired of guessing what is actually on the shelf. Headline: Know what you have, where it is, and when it runs out. Covers: A list of items and locations; Every movement recorded; Stock views for the owner; What to share with us; Real Time Stock Levels; Low Stock Alerts; Multi Location Tracking; Barcode & Scanner Support; Purchase Order Management; Stock Movement Reports. Q: Can this work alongside our existing billing software? A: Yes. Inventory can be built standalone or connected with billing and POS systems we build, so stock updates automatically with every sale. Q: Do we need barcode scanners to use this? A: No, scanners speed things up but are not required. Manual entry works too, scanning is an option, not a requirement. Q: Can it handle multiple warehouses or store locations? A: Yes, stock is tracked per location with a combined view across all of them."},{"id":"page:services/software-development/lms-development.html","type":"page","title":"LMS Development","url":"/services/software-development/lms-development","keywords":[],"text":"Courses, assessments, and progress tracking built for coaching institutes, schools, and training teams, not a generic course marketplace template. Headline: A learning platform students and trainers actually finish. Covers: Courses and learning paths; Assessments and progress; Access for the right learners; What to share with us; Course & Content Management; Online Assessments & Quizzes; Progress Tracking; Live Class Integration; Certificates on Completion; Admin & Parent Dashboards. Q: Is this for schools, coaching institutes, or corporate training? A: All three. The structure adapts to how your courses and batches are organised, whether that is a school syllabus, a coaching batch, or a corporate training module. Q: Can it include live classes, or only recorded content? A: Both. Live sessions can be scheduled and linked, alongside recorded content students can revisit anytime. Q: Do we need to rebuild our existing course content? A: No, existing videos, PDFs, and material can be uploaded and organised into the new structure."},{"id":"page:services/software-development/property-management-software.html","type":"page","title":"Property Management","url":"/services/software-development/property-management-software","keywords":[],"text":"Built for property owners, brokers, and housing societies who need a clear record of units, tenants, and payments. Headline: Property, tenants, and rent collection without the spreadsheet chaos. Covers: Units and occupancy; Rent and payment history; Requests and follow-ups; What to share with us; Unit & Property Listings; Tenant & Lease Records; Rent Collection Tracking; Maintenance Request Logging; Document Storage; Owner Dashboards. Q: Is this for individual owners or property management companies? A: Both. The system scales from a handful of units managed by one owner to a portfolio managed by a team. Q: Can tenants make payments through the system? A: Online payment collection can be added, depending on the payment methods you want to support. Q: Can it handle commercial and residential properties together? A: Yes, both can be tracked in the same system with details relevant to each type."},{"id":"page:services/software-development/saas-platform-development.html","type":"page","title":"SaaS Platform Development","url":"/services/software-development/saas-platform-development","keywords":[],"text":"Multi-tenant architecture, subscription billing, and admin tools built to launch and scale a SaaS product, not just a one-off internal tool. Headline: Turn your software idea into a product other businesses can subscribe to. Covers: A space for each customer; One useful task; Account and subscription tools; What to share with us; Multi-Tenant Architecture; Subscription Billing & Plans; Self-Service Onboarding; Usage Tracking & Limits; Admin & Super Admin Panel; API & Integration Ready. Q: We already have an MVP, can you build on top of it? A: Depends on how it was built, in many cases yes. We will review what exists and tell you honestly whether to extend it or rebuild the core properly. Q: How is this different from a regular web application? A: A regular app is usually built for one business&rsquo;s internal use. A SaaS platform needs multi-tenant data separation, subscription billing, and self-service onboarding built in from the start. Q: Can you help with pricing and plan structure, not just the build? A: We can share what we have seen work for similar products, though pricing strategy itself depends on your market and is ultimately your call."},{"id":"page:services/software-development.html","type":"page","title":"AI Software Development Company Pune, GURU AI TECHNOLOGIES","url":"/services/software-development","keywords":[],"text":"AI software development for tailor-made web applications, dashboards, and internal tools, engineered by a software development company in Pune. Headline: Software shaped around your business, not the other way around.. Covers: Build around the people using it; Create a shared record; Connect the right tools; What to share with us; CRM Development; ERP Development; HRMS Development; Inventory Management; LMS Development; Property Management; Help Desk Software; AI Agents Development. Q: How do you price custom software? A: Every system is scoped individually. After a discovery call we provide a detailed custom quote with milestones — no fixed price lists, no surprises. Q: Can you connect it to tools we already use? A: Usually yes — WhatsApp, payment gateways, Google Workspace, and most modern services expose APIs we can integrate. Q: Who owns the code? A: You do. Full source code, documentation, and deployment access are handed over at delivery."}]}